{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Story</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game follows a group of people that explore the Skull mountains as they try to figure out the mysteries behind these mountains. But as they explore more and more, they get stuck in time when the midnight hits with no other chance of escape than going deep into the lake.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They are hunted by undead monsters, mutants and bizarre creatures all made from the strange moss that corrupts the mountains.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this FPS horror game, you can play as different characters throughout the game and alter their story with your own choices. You solve puzzles, escape from creatures, look for objects and explore your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/LAKESNARE_-_SampleScene_-_Windows,_Mac,_Linux_-_Unity_2022.3.14f1___DX11__30_04_2025_17_59_24.png?t=1750108109\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Fate</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play as different characters and <strong>change</strong> their fate with your decisions. <strong>Every decision</strong> you make can drastically change the story... and sometimes it can result in <strong>death</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Danger</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dangers in these mountains can be <strong>deadly</strong> and unpredictable id you don't pay attention to your surroundings. You can never be sure if you are <strong>safe</strong>... because <strong>they</strong> are watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/LAKESNARE_-_SampleScene_-_Windows,_Mac,_Linux_-_Unity_2022.3.14f1___DX11__30_04_2025_18_41_49_1_.png?t=1750108109\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714300?t=1750108109","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3714300?t=1750108109","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/24ca886d67f82590f852c93929c480c6bc587183/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750108109","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/24ca886d67f82590f852c93929c480c6bc587183/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750108109","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains a decent amount of blood and gore. There's also a lot of violence against humans and creatures."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Story</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game follows a group of people that explore the Skull mountains as they try to figure out the mysteries behind these mountains. But as they explore more and more, they get stuck in time when the midnight hits with no other chance of escape than going deep into the lake.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They are hunted by undead monsters, mutants and bizarre creatures all made from the strange moss that corrupts the mountains.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Gameplay</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this FPS horror game, you can play as different characters throughout the game and alter their story with your own choices. You solve puzzles, escape from creatures, look for objects and explore your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/LAKESNARE_-_SampleScene_-_Windows,_Mac,_Linux_-_Unity_2022.3.14f1___DX11__30_04_2025_17_59_24.png?t=1750108109\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Fate</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can play as different characters and <strong>change</strong> their fate with your decisions. <strong>Every decision</strong> you make can drastically change the story... and sometimes it can result in <strong>death</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>Danger</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dangers in these mountains can be <strong>deadly</strong> and unpredictable id you don't pay attention to your surroundings. You can never be sure if you are <strong>safe</strong>... because <strong>they</strong> are watching.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/extras/LAKESNARE_-_SampleScene_-_Windows,_Mac,_Linux_-_Unity_2022.3.14f1___DX11__30_04_2025_18_41_49_1_.png?t=1750108109\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Jungaar"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714300/8d09112322d9d407bfe430a1aed9993c41e81df4/header.jpg?t=1750108109","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257137459,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137459/movie480.mp4?t=1750108107","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137459/movie_max.mp4?t=1750108107"},"name":"The Midnight Biohazard Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257137459/2115d9eff1b7474a3ebf0c23ef8528f07dd289b3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1750108107","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257137459/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1750108107","max